claude-behavior-skill

Derived in part from "andrej-karpathy-skills" by forrestchang / multica-ai
(https://github.com/multica-ai/andrej-karpathy-skills), which declares an MIT
licence in its skill and plugin manifests. The upstream repository did not
include a separate LICENSE file when this was written (commit 2c60614,
2026-04-20). That repository in turn credits Andrej Karpathy's public
observations on LLM coding pitfalls as its source.

The four upstream principles (Think Before Coding, Simplicity First, Surgical
Changes, Goal-Driven Execution) are adapted and reworded here. Everything else
is original to this repository.
